\ tests/native/kernel-cut.4 - the native kernel's cut, tested (docs/
\ NATIVE.md, N1c; parts 0-3 at Iteration 618, 4-8 at 621): words of
\ kernel.4 compiled natively by forth/native-cross.4, and the same file
\ run on CV8's kernel (tests/native/cv8-kernel-cut.4); the two must print
\ the same. In the kernel's own dialect, between CROSS-COMPILE and END-CROSS.
CROSS-COMPILE
: HEXD  15 AND DUP 9 > IF 39 + THEN 48 + EMIT ;
: P  60 BEGIN DUP 0< 0= WHILE 2DUP RSHIFT HEXD 4 - REPEAT 2DROP 32 EMIT ;
: T-DIV  7 3 /MOD P P  -7 3 /MOD P P  7 -3 /MOD P P  -7 3 MOD P  -7 3 / P  CR ;
: T-MINMAX  5 3 MIN P  5 3 MAX P  -5 3 MIN P  -5 ABS P  5 ABS P  CR ;
: T-ARITH  6 2* P  -6 2/ P  3 4 * P  10 3 7 */ P  10 3 7 */MOD P P  -10 S>D P P  CR ;
: T-DOUBLE  5 7 M* P P  -7 S>D 2 FM/MOD P P  -7 S>D 2 SM/REM P P  1 2 DNEGATE P P  CR ;
: T-MISC  DEPTH P  1 2 DEPTH P 2DROP  TRUE P  BL P  16 CELL- P  3 CHARS P
  1 2 3 4 3 PICK P 2DROP 2DROP  CR ;
: T-STRING  ." hello, native" CR ;
\ parts 4-8: number output, pictured output, moves, the stack, conversion
: T-NUM  -123 . 123 . 0 . -1 U. CR  HEX 255 . -1 . DECIMAL  -5 S>D D.  CR
  123 0 <# # # # #> TYPE  [CHAR] | EMIT  3 SPACES [CHAR] | EMIT  CR ;
: T-MOVE  1 2 3 4 3 ROLL P P P P  1 2 3 4 2OVER P P P P P P  1 2 3 4 2SWAP P P P P  CR
  S" abcdef" PAD SWAP CMOVE  PAD PAD 2 + 3 CMOVE> PAD 6 TYPE  [CHAR] | EMIT
  S" abcdef" PAD SWAP CMOVE  PAD 2 + PAD 3 CMOVE PAD 6 TYPE  CR ;
: T-CONV  S" 1234" PAD PLACE PAD NUMBER? P P P  S" -42" PAD PLACE PAD NUMBER? P P P
  S" 12x" PAD PLACE PAD NUMBER? P DROP DROP  CR ;
: MAIN  DECIMAL  60 EMIT 60 EMIT 60 EMIT CR
  T-DIV T-MINMAX T-ARITH T-DOUBLE T-MISC T-STRING T-NUM T-MOVE T-CONV
  62 EMIT 62 EMIT 62 EMIT CR  0 ;
END-CROSS
